treelite
------------------------------------------
Treelite is a model compiler for efficient deployment of decision tree
ensembles.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libtreelite4-4.8.1-1bl1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libfmt-devel-12.2.0-1bl1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  mdspan-0.6.0-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  nlohmann_json-3.12.0-1bl3
  rapidjson-devel-1.1.0p577-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dmlc/treelite

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dmlc/treelite/archive/refs/tags/4.8.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack treelite-4.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./treelite-4.8.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/treelite-4.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/treelite-4.8.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtreelite4-4.8.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtreelite-devel-4.8.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

